  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder with scvi_n200 in a multimodal multiprofile setup (avgpool, concat), achieving higher validation accuracy (0.6315) than the previous config_018 (0.6186). The slight decrease in F1 (0.6068 vs. 0.6103) suggests potential trade-offs, but the primary metric indicates the RNA encoder choice may be critical. Further experiments are needed to confirm this effect and explore other factors."
